<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fistŭlōsus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Pipeshaped</i>, <i>full of holes</i>,
				<i>porous</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terra bibula et pumicis vice fistulosa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 11, 29, § 110</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 5, 3, § 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">telum culicis sorbendo fistulosum,</span>”
				<i>hollow</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 11,
					2, 1, § 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aculeus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 37, 65, § 173</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapis,</span>”
				<i>porous</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					36, 23, 53, § 174</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">densitas spongiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					27, 8, 45, § 69</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caseus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 8, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Having fistulas</i>, <i>fistulous</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cancer,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 157, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
